{"t":"PSA","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Public Storage","ko":null,"sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Industrial","employees":5770,"hq":"Frisco, TX, United States","website":"https://www.publicstorage.com","summary_en":"Public Storage is a REIT that primarily acquires, develops, owns, and operates self-storage facilities. At September 30, 2026, the firm: (i) owned and/or operated 4,764 self-storage facilities with approximately 339 million net rentable square feet located in 42 states, Puerto Rico and Canada and (ii) owned a 35% common equity interest in Shurgard Self Storage Limited, which owned 338 self-storage facilities located in seven Western European countries with approximately 19 million net rentable square feet operated under the Shurgard brand. Public Storage headquarters are in Frisco, Texas. Public Storage was incorporated in 1972 in Maryland.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"퍼블릭 스토리지(Public Storage)는 주로 셀프 스토리지 시설을 인수, 개발, 소유, 운영하는 REIT입니다. 2026년 9월 30일에 회사는 (i) 42개 주, 푸에르토리코 및 캐나다에 약 3억 3900만 평방피트의 순 임대 가능 평방피트를 갖춘 4,764개의 셀프 스토리지 시설을 소유 및/또는 운영했으며 (ii) Shurgard Self Storage Limited의 35% 공통 지분을 소유했습니다. Shurgard Self Storage Limited는 서유럽 7개 국가에 338개의 셀프 스토리지 시설을 소유했으며 약 1900만 평방피트의 순 임대 가능 평방피트를 Shurgard에서 운영했습니다. 브랜드. Public Storage 본사는 텍사스 주 프리스코에 있습니다. Public Storage는 1972년 메릴랜드에서 설립되었습니다.","val":{"price":340.5,"mcap":63620198400.0,"pe":35.804417,"fpe":34.27871,"peg":4.5889,"ps":12.6144285,"pb":6.5034285,"ev_ebitda":22.894,"div":3.52,"beta":0.871,"hi52":345.8907,"lo52":256.54},"fin":{"rev":5043446784.0,"rev_g":0.108,"eps_g":-0.354,"gross":0.74286,"op":0.39486998,"net":0.37677,"roe":0.15597999,"fcf":2964851712.0,"cash":560379008.0,"debt":12192032768.0,"de":80.106,"eps":9.51,"feps":9.93328},"own":{"short":0.0477,"inst":0.83699,"insider":0.09559},"analyst":{"n":18,"mean":331.83334,"median":334.0,"high":367.0,"low":285.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.54545,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":4,"hold":16,"sell":0,"strongSell":